🔒 CORE CONSTRAINTS (NON-NEGOTIABLE)
Tempo: ~58–64 BPM (slow, predatory, inevitable)
Meter: Free-feeling 4/4 with suspended pulse perception
Key Center: Ambiguous minor (D♯ / E♭ gravity preferred), no functional resolution
Tonality: Microtonal drift allowed; pitch instability encouraged
Dynamic Law: Continuous swell → recoil → swell (never flat, never looping cleanly)
Emotion Rule: Recognition without empathy

🧬 HARMONIC DNA
Static low-register drone built on minor seconds + tritones
Harmonic motion occurs via timbre shift, not chord change
Avoid triads, avoid cadences, avoid tonal comfort
Occasional cluster blooms that fade before resolving

🥁 RHYTHMIC BEHAVIOR
No traditional groove
Pulse implied through:
Low-frequency pressure waves
Breathing-like amplitude modulation
Percussion elements:
Distant, muffled impacts (felt more than heard)
Irregular sub hits that do not repeat evenly
Silence is used as tension, not relief

🎛️ INSTRUMENTATION STACK
Primary Mass:
Analog synth drone (slow LFO pitch wobble, tape-warped)
Organic Intrusion:
Processed string harmonics (bow noise > pitch)
Reversed or stretched vocal textures (genderless, wordless)
Textural Parasites:
High-frequency shimmer artifacts
Metallic resonance tails that feel biological
No Lead Instrument. No Melody Anchor.

🧠 STRUCTURAL PROCEDURE (IMPORTANT)
Phase 1 — Observation (0–90s)
Sparse texture
Drone breathes slowly
Space feels empty but watched

Phase 2 — Recognition (90–210s)
New overtones appear without introduction
Harmonic density increases
Listener feels noticed

Phase 3 — Assimilation (210s–end)
Volume and density peak without climax
Elements blur together
End does not resolve—sound simply withdraws, incomplete

🎚️ PRODUCTION & MIX LAW
Extreme stereo width with unstable center
Low end should feel claustrophobic, not powerful
Reverb tails are long but dirty
Subtle tape hiss and distortion always present
Nothing clean. Nothing sharp. Nothing heroic.

🚫 HARD BANS
❌ No melody hooks
❌ No rhythmic loops
❌ No emotional release
❌ No cinematic “payoff”
❌ No human warmth

🧠 INTENT STATEMENT (FOR THE MODEL)
This music is not threatening.
It is indifferent.
It does not attack.
It continues.